# Athlete UI

Mobile first: 375, 390, 430. Then tablet and desktop.

Use the existing athlete shell, cards, and type scale in `components/athlete-command-centre/athleteUi.tsx`. Visual direction is `docs/HYBRID365_VISUAL_SYSTEM.md`.

Empty, loading, and error states say what is true. Do not render mock charts, fake coach notes, or sample race splits. If a flag is off, keep the current screen.

Coach preview passes `readOnly`. Hide submit and log actions. Do not call a mutation endpoint from preview.

Athlete-facing weekly copy is `athlete_facing_note` only. If it is empty, hide the section.
